    "detailed_description": "You are one of a few left of a rare species, called Venox, which are pretty advanced aliens that have matured for millions of years to be able to merge with mecha parts accross the universe!<br><br>Venox are hungry for new mecha discoveries, so they ended up being planet invaders, where they invade to mine minerals and upgrade their powers.<br><br>But as always, they are fearless and reckless, so they end up crashing their Titan ship while landing every time.<br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Protect your Titan ship at all costs! Enemies will try to attack the Titan ship every few minutes in waves.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/a1cdee137506e7ac642f3c87b50a5b07.poster.avif?t=1690174885\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/a1cdee137506e7ac642f3c87b50a5b07.webm?t=1690174885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/a1cdee137506e7ac642f3c87b50a5b07.mp4?t=1690174885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Every Day, most of the enemies will burn!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/7629f0f92dfd39e03c284c2aafff251a.poster.avif?t=1690174885\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/7629f0f92dfd39e03c284c2aafff251a.webm?t=1690174885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/7629f0f92dfd39e03c284c2aafff251a.mp4?t=1690174885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Explore the planet and mine to gain resources, but watch out from enemies that may be around!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/03719e83ffdb12e66c29fb40233344eb.poster.avif?t=1690174885\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/03719e83ffdb12e66c29fb40233344eb.webm?t=1690174885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/03719e83ffdb12e66c29fb40233344eb.mp4?t=1690174885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Once you gather enough resources (that you can carry!) get back to the Titan ship.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/5c2ea853a7d3d96279a238210be5e220.poster.avif?t=1690174885\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/5c2ea853a7d3d96279a238210be5e220.webm?t=1690174885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br></li><li> Upgrade and Repair your Titan ship.<br></li><li> Research mecha parts from the collected minerals! You can merge with the mecha parts to gain new abilities<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/04a07b2b3c36c1fe48c07bec48aa0fdb.poster.avif?t=1690174885\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/04a07b2b3c36c1fe48c07bec48aa0fdb.webm?t=1690174885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/04a07b2b3c36c1fe48c07bec48aa0fdb.mp4?t=1690174885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/3b8626eb790290b01ef9ad08451cfce8.poster.avif?t=1690174885\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/3b8626eb790290b01ef9ad08451cfce8.webm?t=1690174885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br></li><li> You can merge with your Titan ship to gain more stats and control your Titan ship.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/3c4a3aba30a4d23cd9c12dc44f2d5949.poster.avif?t=1690174885\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/3c4a3aba30a4d23cd9c12dc44f2d5949.webm?t=1690174885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2361260/extras/3c4a3aba30a4d23cd9c12dc44f2d5949.mp4?t=1690174885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br></li><li> Level up your stats after killing enemies.<br></li><li> You win if you manage to find the ancient crystal that your Titan ship needs to leave the planet!<br></li><li>  You lose if your Titan ship gets destroyed or the Enemies kill you.</li></ul>",
